{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t巴基斯坦南部信德省一輛救護車有氧氣瓶發生爆炸，當地警方說，造成至少10人死亡。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n事發在當地星期三晚，當地官員表示，涉事救護車當時停放在特爾巴格爾地區一間醫療機構內，車上有一名孕婦。氧氣瓶在安裝過程中發生爆炸，引發火警。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n警方表示，專家已到場調查，確定爆炸原因。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：鄭皓璟\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T09:42:13.241738+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T09:11:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T01:58:52.374693+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T09:38:36.124168+00:00","content_hash":"0c87b86a08aa091afadc066ba87d88eac6339d3d9142242c4f2174af7fdddc19","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}